    "detailed_description": "Headlong Hunt is a puzzle game about guiding a skittish animal. Capture it by using simple interactions in surprisingly deep and satisfying ways - be two steps ahead as you choose to hide from sight or send the creature bolting. Think forwards and backwards to set up the perfect path to victory.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/a7787b15b95963ada05761468b1990a9.poster.avif?t=1705834634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/a7787b15b95963ada05761468b1990a9.webm?t=1705834634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/a7787b15b95963ada05761468b1990a9.mp4?t=1705834634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/692a4d844564e381deef2a858654c65f.poster.avif?t=1705834634\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/692a4d844564e381deef2a858654c65f.webm?t=1705834634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323660/extras/692a4d844564e381deef2a858654c65f.mp4?t=1705834634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Features: <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 100 expertly-crafted puzzles<br></li><li> Elegant mechanics which elaborate on the central theme and interact in surprising ways <br></li><li> A seamless overworld map, with two main paths and optional islands<br></li><li> Unique painterly art style and atmospheric original soundtrack<br></li><li> Smooth controls including undo and undo through reset<br></li><li> Full controller support and control rebinding</li></ul><br>I also have a discord server where you could discuss or ask for hints:<br>",
